This repo publishes the central reusable GitHub Actions workflows consumed by
every other Devotica Terraform repository: terraform-module-ci.yml (called by
module repos like terraform-aws-vpc / terraform-aws-iam / terraform-aws-s3)
and terraform-project-ci.yml (called by project repos like sample-infra).

Consumers pin against the floating @v1 tag which is repointed on every release.

